    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level and every even level thereafter, a dragoon’s drake companion gains a combat talent; although it may not select the beastmastery sphere or any other sphere talent which would grant it a familiar, animal companion, eidolon, or drake companion. A dragoon's drake uses Strength as its practitioner ability modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dragoon-class#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
